{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maroxyn Drarea</strong> is a first-person horror experience set in a dead, desolate parallel realm - a place where the laws of nature twist, strange lifeforms watch from the dark, and the land itself seems determined to keep you trapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your escape lies somewhere beyond the ruins, beneath the shadow of a colossal, ancient tree. But getting there means navigating a maze of ruined stone, distorted terrain, and unseen threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stripped of your full magical strength, you\u2019re left with only three spells:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>\u2022 A<strong> Light</strong>\u00a0spell cast from your right hand, this spell illuminates the dark and reveals the path ahead. But light draws attention, and not everything that sees you means well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/Light_Spell_GIF.gif?t=1750630700\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A\u00a0<strong>Scanner</strong>\u00a0spell that sends out a pulse across the terrain to reveal hidden trigger points - key to unlocking the final portal. But scan too much, and you might invite something worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/Scanner_Spell_GIF.gif?t=1750630700\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A\u00a0<strong>Shield</strong>\u00a0spell that is cast from your left hand, creating a short-lived barrier to buy you some protection when under attack. It won't last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/Shield_Spell_GIF.gif?t=1750630700\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some creatures roam aimlessly. Some wait for your light. Others are drawn to the vibrations in the ground. And some... some are there only for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat. No guidance. Just you, your limited spells, and a world that reacts to every move you make.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810130?t=1750630700","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810130?t=1750630700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/64c714fe1829ee6b2085c25a3c5eb1a6883a6c55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750630700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/64c714fe1829ee6b2085c25a3c5eb1a6883a6c55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750630700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maroxyn Drarea</strong> is a first-person horror experience set in a dead, desolate parallel realm - a place where the laws of nature twist, strange lifeforms watch from the dark, and the land itself seems determined to keep you trapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your escape lies somewhere beyond the ruins, beneath the shadow of a colossal, ancient tree. But getting there means navigating a maze of ruined stone, distorted terrain, and unseen threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stripped of your full magical strength, you\u2019re left with only three spells:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>\u2022 A<strong> Light</strong>\u00a0spell cast from your right hand, this spell illuminates the dark and reveals the path ahead. But light draws attention, and not everything that sees you means well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/Light_Spell_GIF.gif?t=1750630700\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A\u00a0<strong>Scanner</strong>\u00a0spell that sends out a pulse across the terrain to reveal hidden trigger points - key to unlocking the final portal. But scan too much, and you might invite something worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/Scanner_Spell_GIF.gif?t=1750630700\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A\u00a0<strong>Shield</strong>\u00a0spell that is cast from your left hand, creating a short-lived barrier to buy you some protection when under attack. It won't last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/Shield_Spell_GIF.gif?t=1750630700\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some creatures roam aimlessly. Some wait for your light. Others are drawn to the vibrations in the ground. And some... some are there only for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat. No guidance. Just you, your limited spells, and a world that reacts to every move you make.</p>","developers":["CrowsBeak"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descript